		(at 142.5 74.21 -90)
		(descr "MYOUNG BH-123A-A1CJ002 through-hole CR123A holder, LCSC C5290177, PA66 housing 43.3x18.2x14.2 mm, Ni-plated SUS304 contacts. Pin 1 + (the peg end), pin 2 -. Terminals 37.5 mm apart in 1.8 mm holes; 2.0 mm NPTH for the housing's 1.4 mm locating peg, 8.4 mm off the terminal axis at the + end. The drawing's PCB layout is a bottom view; this is the top view (matches LCSC's EasyEDA footprint). https://wmsc.lcsc.com/wmsc/upload/file/pdf/v2/lcsc/2406281144_MYOUNG-BH-123A-A1CJ002_C5290177.pdf")
